WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:02,550
continue

2
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,870
I know you don't want to go back

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:08,190
But mom misses you so much

4
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,570
We also need your presence at the engagement party. Come back with me.

5
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:14,410
I give you 33% of the shares of the Su family as a deal.

6
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,770
In this way, the family will be harmonious and everyone will be well.

7
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,760
Not so good

8
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,760
33% of the shares of the Su family

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,480
The annual dividends are huge, so think about it again.

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:31,010
Waiter, check out with a black card. I’m not short of money.

11
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:32,650
I don’t care about the Su family’s shares either.

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:36,760
I don’t even have time to play house with you.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Acting on family harmony

14
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,720
Say goodbye to this

15
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:43,910
The news that the Su family has found their biological daughter has spread, and there must be a result.

16
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,790
Otherwise, the old man and mother will not give up and will continue to look for you.

17
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,110
And United Family can’t be in peace either.
